{"parse": {"title": "TTL-08", "pageid": 28158, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TTL-07\" title=\"TTL-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TTL-08</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TTL</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.B0.8F.E5.B0.8F.E8.B0.83.E6.9F.A5.E5.91.98\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"小小调查员\">小小调查员</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 小小调查员</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Young Investigator</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1770308</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一本微茫的书在无边无际的黑夜中漂流着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>过往的每一页在马库斯的脑海中迅速掠过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如在昨日，如在眼前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我想起来了……我希望能做出一个属于自己的选择……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>为此，我加入了基金会……我知道了“暴雨”……我告别了我的时代…………我的理想……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我……做出了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>突如其来的剧痛几乎要把整本书都撕裂开来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>书脊颤抖着揭开新的一页。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_at_texiao3.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_at_texiao3\"><img alt=\"1_7_at_texiao3\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/Cg-1_7_at_texiao3.png/600px-Cg-1_7_at_texiao3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/Cg-1_7_at_texiao3.png/900px-Cg-1_7_at_texiao3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/Cg-1_7_at_texiao3.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_at_texiao3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>是的，我做到了。可我的选择……几乎摧毁了所有人的努力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>伊索尔德女士举办了一场盛大的沙龙演说，在那儿，她发表了……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_at_texiao1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_at_texiao1\"><img alt=\"1_7_at_texiao1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-1_7_at_texiao1.png/600px-Cg-1_7_at_texiao1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-1_7_at_texiao1.png/900px-Cg-1_7_at_texiao1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-1_7_at_texiao1.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_at_texiao1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊索尔德：</div><div>我希望，我们神秘学家能够联合起来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊索尔德：</div><div>——建立一个不再有压抑的、自由的、属于我们自己的独立王国！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_at_texiao2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_at_texiao2\"><img alt=\"1_7_at_texiao2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-1_7_at_texiao2.png/600px-Cg-1_7_at_texiao2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-1_7_at_texiao2.png/900px-Cg-1_7_at_texiao2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-1_7_at_texiao2.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_at_texiao2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>这全是我的错……如果我没有违反保密条例，这场叛国演讲也不会发生……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我的努力非但没有帮到任何一位神秘学家，甚至加重了他们与人类之间的隔阂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>重塑蒙蔽了伊索尔德女士，还有许多无辜的神秘学家……他们本不应陷入如此困境……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>政治刺杀、民族冲突、城市混乱……历史发生了震荡，暴雨发生了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306516.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-306516.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306516.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306516.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-306516.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306516.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-306516.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306516.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>不、不！也许我从一开始就不应该叫住霍夫曼女士……我应该一直留在弗兰南群岛！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-306513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-306513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-306513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>霍夫曼……女士？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而后是更清晰，令人更难以喘息的一页。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_at_huofumanzhisi3.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_at_huofumanzhisi3\"><img alt=\"1_7_at_huofumanzhisi3\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/Cg-1_7_at_huofumanzhisi3.png/600px-Cg-1_7_at_huofumanzhisi3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/Cg-1_7_at_huofumanzhisi3.png/900px-Cg-1_7_at_huofumanzhisi3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/Cg-1_7_at_huofumanzhisi3.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_at_huofumanzhisi3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306516.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-306516.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306516.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306516.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-306516.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306516.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-306516.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306516.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>霍夫曼女士——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍夫曼：</div><div>咳……马库斯，不要落泪。我知道自己在做什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍夫曼：</div><div>未来是……你们的时代。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306515.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/HeadIconSmall-306515.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306515.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306515.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/HeadIconSmall-306515.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306515.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/HeadIconSmall-306515.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306515.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>不——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是无比漫长的一页。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>唔——！我究竟做到了什么呢……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无数的画面在混乱的意识中交织着，漫长的痛苦与遗憾挤占着马库斯的意识。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>在岛上，我没能阻止朋友们的争吵，没能改变人类对于神秘学家的偏见，没能解决任何一场争端……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>而当我踏入基金会，我的选择迫使更多人受到了伤害，就连霍夫曼女士也因我而死……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我一次都没能践行自我的理想……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>难道、难道我——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个冰冷而令人绝望的现实耸立在她的面前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……我从来都没有离开过弗兰南群岛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>活跃的细胞在汹涌的痛苦中终于找到了出口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在一阵古怪的香气中，马库斯的视野愈发模糊。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_juyuanhoutai.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_juyuanhoutai\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_juyuanhoutai\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/Cg-1_7_bg_juyuanhoutai.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_juyuanhoutai.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/Cg-1_7_bg_juyuanhoutai.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_juyuanhoutai.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/Cg-1_7_bg_juyuanhoutai.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_juyuanhoutai.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“唐纳德”：</div><div>马……马库斯，你怎么会在这儿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“杜卡特”：</div><div>噢，可怜的小马库斯，你看上去真狼狈……你遇到什么不好的事了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“马歇尔”：</div><div>别担心，我的朋友，我们一直在这儿，我们会帮你！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>幽灵们一如既往地凑在她的跟前，热情地手舞足蹈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>杜卡特先生……唐纳德先生……马歇尔先生……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>情绪终于决堤，在这片无风的岛屿中找到了得以喘息的港口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>你们不对我失望吗……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>在弗兰南群岛，我试图写下对于历史的纪实，可人们将它视作故事，夸赞它的情节、它的悬念……可这些连半点都不属于我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我没能解开岛上的谜团，没能让更多人理解神秘学……我所谓的理想，只是一个用来逃避的借口……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我逃到了基金会，逃到了维也纳……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……可我仍然一事无成。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我没能帮上霍夫曼女士的忙，没能阻止重塑，没能找到免疫“暴雨”的术式……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我几乎搞砸了一切——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>脱口而出的懊恼并没有如期地碎裂在地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>几双近乎透明的手接住了它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“杜卡特”：</div><div>不，小马库斯。尽管不知道你究竟遇上了什么，但事实并没有你想象得那么糟糕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“唐纳德”：</div><div>我……我们都为你骄傲！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>但是，我什么也没帮上你们……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“马歇尔”：</div><div>你怎么会这么想呢？我的朋友！——你为我们写出了一个精彩的故事，让人们永远地记住了弗兰南群岛，也记住了我们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“杜卡特”：</div><div>是的，你帮了我们许多忙，是我们的英雄。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>可我连你们死亡的真相都没能找到，我辜负了你们的期待……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的头埋得很低，肩膀不住地颤抖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“杜卡特”：</div><div>呵呵……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>某种熟悉的温和触感又一次抵达了肩头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“杜卡特”：</div><div>别苛责自己，小马库斯。就连我们也没能找到自己变成这样的原因呢～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“杜卡特”：</div><div>——可正因如此，我们始终留在这儿，始终奋不顾身地努力着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“杜卡特”：</div><div>能够坦然面对“一段缺乏真相的现实”，清晰地理解这一点，却仍愿意向前迈步的人们，不是更加可敬么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>恍然中，她又想起了那篇故事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它何以成功，又何以受无数人喜爱？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“杜卡特”：</div><div>……你还记得那些读者来信吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“杜卡特”：</div><div>他们的结论千奇百怪，逻辑也满是漏洞……可我们仍然乐此不疲地讨论着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“杜卡特”：</div><div>——最重要的从来都不是尘埃落地的唯一的解，而是我们为真相一路追寻的心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-306513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-306513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-306513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>马库斯终于抬起头来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>霍夫曼女士……她自始至终都明白这一点，也试图将它教导给我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……我领会了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>如果我将在今天死去，我会明白自己应该做什么吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我想，我明白了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她站起身来，一如当时朝着海岸踏出的那一步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我并不畏惧死亡，我害怕的是一无所知地死去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">唐纳德：</div><div>马库斯，你、你听到了什么奇怪的声音吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_juyuanhoutai.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_juyuanhoutai\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_juyuanhoutai\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/Cg-1_7_bg_juyuanhoutai.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_juyuanhoutai.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/Cg-1_7_bg_juyuanhoutai.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_juyuanhoutai.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/Cg-1_7_bg_juyuanhoutai.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_juyuanhoutai.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她深呼吸了一口气，猛然睁开了眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我……我们还能挽回这一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>等一下，医生！我想到了一个可能性——！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TTL-08"}}